{"title":"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems/Problem 17","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee941ad14243acce7b8f220e8496e3d5080b9cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P4R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/6/a265d617b21bd8b558424f5ec6e4bcf74b86e3df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7QS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/99120fd910eac3a7feceaf798a22095c57ab0e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TU1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> is a positive three-digit integer. The sum of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee941ad14243acce7b8f220e8496e3d5080b9cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P4R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/6/a265d617b21bd8b558424f5ec6e4bcf74b86e3df.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$7QS$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"37\" height=\"18\" /> is equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/1/99120fd910eac3a7feceaf798a22095c57ab0e50.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$TU1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" />, as shown.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>If each of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" /> represents a different digit from the list <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, what is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/b/2abc9265b98dff54e9e23139aeae011895e6f50b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 0 \\qquad \\textbf{(B)}\\ 2 \\qquad \\textbf{(C)}\\ 3 \\qquad \\textbf{(D)}\\ 5 \\qquad \\textbf{(E)}\\ 8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We can realise that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/e/9fe94b5b56d26a306fcbcf45853e3d498dfc4361.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R + S = 11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"93\" height=\"16\" /> because their sum ends in a <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, but the minimum sum of the digits is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/e/b1ef0539712d984e882ecbad513bd7e6bbbaa80e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0 + 2 = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"76\" height=\"15\" /> and the maximum is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/e/7ce2e9bb665f488c420a285def115340e8ca0ec4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8 + 9 = 17$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" />. This means that one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> while the other is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, or one of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> while the other is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/f/2/bf2c9074b396e3af0dea52d792660eea1c77f10f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> based on the allowed digits.\n</p><p>Next, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/9/ee941ad14243acce7b8f220e8496e3d5080b9cac.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P4R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"39\" height=\"14\" /> must be a three-digit integer, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/f/cdff03e9720b5bcdcc4d05924a552425889f3960.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P \\neq 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"49\" height=\"18\" />. However, if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/4/9f4d25d6884a154f1421c7b802694ef8d4791f7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P \\geq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"49\" height=\"17\" />, then the sum will be more than <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/5/d/a5db76a43a81c1493f72279a4fe22ec4373520c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$300 + 700 = 1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"139\" height=\"15\" />, making the sum a four-digit number as opposed to a three-digit integer. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/9/1a9d23a7c780a4d945cbfb68c364ab07fd84d8d8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P = 2$\" width=\"47\" height=\"12\" /> (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> is not included in the allowed digits), and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/a/45a35ab1db92ae910d8437b0d40674c4413c1686.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T = 9$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"48\" height=\"14\" />. This means that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> cannot be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/4/4b4cade9ca8a2c8311fafcf040bc5b15ca507f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/6/9866e3a998d628ba0941eb4fea0666ac391d149a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"16\" height=\"18\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/f/eff43e84f8a3bcf7b6965f0a3248bc4d3a9d0cd4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$R$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/d/2/ad28c83c99a8fd0dd2e2e594c9d02ee532765a0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$S$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/5/5/2554b6496c3b678897e9b060ef00aa9f0a7d7ece.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$T$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" /> must be distinct, so one of them must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and the other must be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems/Problem_17&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>From this, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/8/c6878713578626763c38433b3f4c8c2205ad0c15.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$11$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> carries <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/b/51bbaf9edc645c5c6fe88618595c39482954aac7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 + 1 + Q = 5 + Q$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"149\" height=\"18\" /> must end in the same digit as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/b/e2bbebb3bd73f1ae5c64098ab0244f739abf7ca4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U$\" width=\"14\" height=\"12\" />. The remaining available digits are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. However, there cannot be any carrying because then the resulting number would be a four-digit integer and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/2/d/e2db1f00de266bd67fdc8a4b82718454e40a7ebe.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 + 5 = 10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"85\" height=\"15\" /> results in carrying, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/0/f/20f86299b10bb5ac4046c032dc841f3d316d6e5c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$Q = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/1/8/318c5a661d984b4b950f57be41c212fcf0299377.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$U = \\boxed{\\textbf {(D) } 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"97\" height=\"30\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)\">2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8)</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"2026 CEMC Gauss (Grade 8) Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2026_CEMC_Gauss_(Grade_8)_Answer_Key&amp;action=e